Subject: [PATCH] The brief-inventory API, round 3: two laws CfgRecord reads
 that were private (finding 2's ledger)

- CounterLoop: `counterWord_succ`, the counter word's successor case (it existed only as the
  private `counter_word_succ`, which keeps its uses).
- Catalog: `scanResult_keep_keep`, the identity scan, from `scanResult_fold`.

Found by the review's corrected unfolding ledger of Build/CfgRecord (explicit and definitional
sites). The review sub-agent's `r3-repair-2.patch`, applied unchanged. Declarations only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../TuringMachine/Build/Catalog.lean          | 19 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../TuringMachine/Build/CounterLoop.lean      |  9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

